---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Iskalnik tekov" description="Iskalnik tekaških prireditev po datumu, regiji, podlagi in razdalji.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero container" aria-labelledby="search-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">Iskalnik tekov</span>
      <h1 id="search-title">Poiščite svoj naslednji tek</h1>
      <p>
        Preverite potrjene javne tekaške prireditve za izbrano leto. Iščete lahko po imenu teka ali kraju.
        Izbor lahko zožite po mesecu, regiji, podlagi, razdalji in družinski prijaznosti.
      </p>
      <div class="year-switcher" aria-label="Izbira leta koledarja">
        <a class="year-switcher-link" href="/iskalnik-tekov/" data-year-link="2026">Koledar 2026</a>
        <a class="year-switcher-link" href="/iskalnik-tekov/?year=2027" data-year-link="2027">Koledar 2027</a>
      </div>
      <p class="calendar-year-notice" data-year-notice hidden>Koledar 2027 se dopolnjuje.</p>
    </section>


    <form class="finder-workspace container" data-search-form>
      <aside class="finder-sidebar" aria-labelledby="filters-title">
        <h2 id="filters-title">Filtri</h2>

        <div class="finder-primary-filters">
          <label class="field">
            <span>Iskanje</span>
            <input type="search" name="search" placeholder="Ime teka ali kraj" autocomplete="off" data-filter="search" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span>Mesec</span>
            <select name="month" data-filter="month" disabled><option value="">Vsi meseci</option></select>
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span>Regija</span>
            <select name="region" data-filter="region" disabled><option value="">Vse regije</option></select>
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span>Razdalja</span>
            <select name="distance" data-filter="distance">
              <option value="all">Vse razdalje</option>
              <option value="up-to-5">Do 5 km</option>
              <option value="over-5-to-10">Nad 5 do 10 km</option>
              <option value="over-10-to-half">Nad 10 do 21,1 km</option>
              <option value="over-half-to-marathon">Nad 21,1 do 42,2 km</option>
              <option value="ultra">Nad 42,2 km</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-picks" aria-label="Hitri izbori">
          <p>Hitri izbori</p>
          <div class="quick-picks-list">
            <button class="quick-pick" type="button" data-quick-pick="deadlines-soon">Roki se iztekajo</button>
            <button class="quick-pick" type="button" data-quick-pick="budget">Poceni teki</button>
            <button class="quick-pick" type="button" data-quick-pick="first-race">Za prvi tek</button>
            <button class="quick-pick" type="button" data-quick-pick="trail">Trail izzivi</button>
            <button class="quick-pick" type="button" data-quick-pick="kids">Z otroki</button>
            <button class="quick-pick" type="button" data-quick-pick="route">S traso</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <details class="finder-more-filters" data-more-filters>
          <summary data-advanced-filters-summary>Več filtrov</summary>
          <div class="finder-more-filters-content">
            <label class="field"><span>Podlaga</span><select name="surface" data-filter="surface" disabled><option value="">Vse podlage</option></select></label>
            <label class="field"><span>Startnina</span><select name="registrationFee" data-filter="registration-fee"><option value="">Vse startnine</option><option value="free-option">Ima brezplačno možnost</option><option value="10">Do 10 €</option><option value="20">Do 20 €</option><option value="30">Do 30 €</option><option value="50">Do 50 €</option></select><small>Startnina uporablja najnižjo znano startnino. Roki vključujejo predprijave in cenejše prijave; možnost “s traso” pomeni povezavo do trase, zemljevida ali GPX, ne nujno GPX datoteke.</small></label>
            <label class="field"><span>Rok prijave</span><select name="deadlineFilter" data-filter="deadline"><option value="">Vsi roki</option><option value="within-7">Rok v 7 dneh</option><option value="within-14">Rok v 14 dneh</option><option value="within-30">Rok v 30 dneh</option><option value="early-ending">Cenejša prijava se izteka</option><option value="race-day">Tudi na dan tekme</option></select></label>
            <label class="checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" name="family" data-filter="family" /><span>Družinam prijazno</span></label>
            <label class="checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" name="dayOfRegistration" data-filter="day-of-registration" /><span>Prijave na dan dogodka</span></label>
            <label class="checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" name="route" data-filter="route" /><span>Ima traso / zemljevid</span></label>
            <label class="field advanced-elevation-field"><span>Višinski metri</span><select name="elevation" data-filter="elevation"><option value="">Vsi višinci</option><option value="max-300">Do 300 m+</option><option value="max-800">Do 800 m+</option><option value="max-1500">Do 1500 m+</option><option value="over-1500">Nad 1500 m+</option></select></label>
          </div>
        </details>

        <section class="race-preferences-panel" data-race-preferences-panel data-preferences-ready="false" aria-labelledby="race-preferences-title-sl">
          <div class="race-preferences-compact" data-preferences-compact tabindex="-1" hidden>
            <h3 id="race-preferences-title-sl">Teki zame</h3>
            <p class="race-preferences-state" data-preferences-state-text></p>
            <p class="race-preferences-summary" data-preferences-summary></p>
            <div class="race-preferences-actions race-preferences-compact-actions">
              <button class="button button-small button-primary" type="button" data-activate-preferences hidden>Prikažite teke zame</button>
              <button class="button button-small button-secondary-light" type="button" data-edit-preferences aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="race-preferences-form-sl">Uredite</button>
              <button class="button button-small button-secondary-light" type="button" data-show-all-races hidden>Prikažite vse teke</button>
              <button class="button button-small button-secondary-light preference-reset-compact" type="button" data-reset-preferences>Ponastavite</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="race-preferences-form" id="race-preferences-form-sl" data-preferences-form hidden>
            <h3 class="race-preferences-form-heading" tabindex="-1" data-preferences-form-heading>Izberite preference</h3>
            <div class="race-preferences-grid">
              <fieldset class="preference-fieldset"><legend>Želene razdalje</legend><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-distance="up-to-5" /> <span>Do 5 km</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-distance="over-5-to-10" /> <span>5–10 km</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-distance="over-10-to-half" /> <span>10–21,1 km</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-distance="over-half-to-marathon" /> <span>21,1–42,2 km</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-distance="ultra" /> <span>Nad 42,2 km</span></label></fieldset>
              <fieldset class="preference-fieldset"><legend>Želene podlage</legend><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-surface="road" /> <span>Cesta</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-surface="trail" /> <span>Trail</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-surface="mountain" /> <span>Gorski tek</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-family /> <span>Prednost družinam prijaznim tekom</span></label></fieldset>
              <fieldset class="preference-fieldset preference-regions"><legend>Želene regije</legend><details><summary>Izberite regije</summary><div class="preference-region-list" data-preference-regions></div></details></fieldset>
            </div>
            <div class="race-preferences-actions"><button class="button button-small button-primary" type="button" data-save-preferences>Shrani in prikaži teke zame</button><button class="button button-small button-secondary-light" type="button" data-cancel-preferences hidden>Prekličite urejanje</button><button class="button button-small button-secondary-light" type="button" data-reset-preferences-form hidden>Ponastavite preference</button></div>
          </div>
          <p class="race-preferences-message visually-hidden" data-preferences-message aria-live="polite"></p>
        </section>

        <div class="filter-actions">
          <button class="button button-small button-secondary-light clear-filters-button" type="button" data-clear-filters>Počistite filtre</button>
          <button class="button button-small button-secondary-light copy-link-button" type="button" data-copy-link>Kopiraj povezavo</button>
          <span class="muted-note" data-copy-link-status aria-live="polite"></span>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <section class="finder-results-column" aria-labelledby="results-title">
        <div class="finder-results-toolbar">
          <div class="finder-results-heading">
            <div><h2 id="results-title">Rezultati</h2><p class="result-count" data-result-count>Dogodke nalagamo …</p></div>
            <label class="field finder-sort-field"><span>Razvrsti po</span><select name="sort" data-filter="sort"><option value="date">Datumu</option><option value="my-races" disabled>Teki zame</option><option value="registration-deadline">Roki prijav najprej</option><option value="registration-min">Najcenejši najprej</option><option value="registration-max">Najdražji najprej</option></select></label>
          </div>
          <p data-search-status>Nalagamo potrjene javne dogodke …</p>
          <div class="active-filters" data-active-filters hidden><div class="active-filters-heading"><strong data-active-filters-title>Aktivni filtri</strong><span data-active-filters-count></span><button class="button button-small button-secondary-light" type="button" data-clear-filters>Počistite vse</button></div><div class="active-filter-list" data-active-filter-list></div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="additional-data-note" data-additional-note hidden>Pri nekaterih tekih so dodane tudi startnine, roki prijav, trase ali višinski metri.</p>
        <div class="search-results" data-search-results aria-live="polite"><article class="event-card"><h3>Podatke še nalagamo</h3><p>Seznam prihajajočih tekov bo prikazan tukaj.</p><div class="event-meta"><span class="pill">Koledar</span></div></article></div>
        <div class="search-more" data-search-more hidden><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-show-more>Prikažite več</button></div>
      </section>
    </form>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { initializeRaceFinder } from '../finder/race-finder-controller';
  import { sloveneRaceFinderLocale } from '../finder/race-finder-locales';

  initializeRaceFinder(sloveneRaceFinderLocale);
</script>
